        <developerName>CDF1</developerName>
        <label>Response Time (Days)</label>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </customDetailFormulas>
    <description>Time elapsed between when OEM last submitted quote line until Intel responded, calculated as Approved/Rejected Date minus Last Submitted Date. Excludes time Intel spent prior to Customer Revision and time quote line was in Draft status for OEM to update.</description>
